---
/** 메인 첫 화면: 교회 사진 + 환영 문구 + 버튼 2개 (내용은 site.json 의 hero) */
import { site } from '../../data/site';
import Emoji from '../Emoji.astro';
import type { EmojiName } from '../../lib/emoji';
const h = site.hero;
/** 버튼이 가는 곳에 맞는 이모티콘 (없으면 글자만) */
const emojiFor = (href: string): EmojiName | undefined =>
  /services/.test(href) ? 'church' : /welcome/.test(href) ? 'wave' : /directions/.test(href) ? 'pin' : /offering/.test(href) ? 'heart' : /sermons|series/.test(href) ? 'play' : undefined;
const [e1, e2] = [emojiFor(h.primary.href), emojiFor(h.secondary.href)];
---
<section class="hero on-dark" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <img class="hero__img" src={h.image} alt={h.alt} fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
  <div class="hero__scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container hero__content">
    {h.eyebrow && <p class="hero__eyebrow">{h.eyebrow}</p>}
    <h1 id="hero-title" class="hero__title">{h.headline}</h1>
    {h.subline && <p class="hero__sub">{h.subline}</p>}
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="btn btn-light btn-lg" href={h.primary.href}>{e1 && <Emoji name={e1} size={24} />}{h.primary.label}</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg" href={h.secondary.href}>{e2 && <Emoji name={e2} size={24} />}{h.secondary.label}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
